      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "It is shown that the LDL peroxide lipid products level is 1.6-4 times higher in patients with the ischemic heart diseases (IHD) than in normal subjects. At the same time the LDL uptake by macrophages was identical in case of normal subjects and of IHD patients. It is suggested that the LDL premodification in the blood flow in the IHD patients promotes the further modification of LDL particles after their penetration into the vessel wall."},
